      "blocks": {
        "tech_fp_heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "We Want to Share the Joy of Being in Nature Through Our Products: Circular Manufacturing at NANGA"
          }
        },
        "tech_fp_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Creating products that reduce environmental impact, and that give back to nature, is a natural responsibility for NANGA, a brand whose field is nature itself. We believe that valuing resources and reusing them is a fundamental yet essential action. \"Re:ACT\" transforms old down products into new NANGA down products. \"Re:CYCLE MATERIAL\" hands limited resources on to the future. \"AFTER CARE\" helps customers enjoy their products for longer. By taking the lead in these actions, NANGA continues to work toward a future where taking care of things and using them for a long time is simply the norm.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "tech_fp_heading",
        "tech_fp_text"
